        },
        {
         "text": "There are $5 \\times 12 = 60$ payments."
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "title": "Write the total as a series",
       "lines": [
        {
         "text": "The first payment earns interest for 59 months. The last earns none."
        },
        {
         "tex": "\\text{Total} &= 150(1.004)^{59} + 150(1.004)^{58} + \\cdots + 150(1.004) + 150"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "title": "Reverse the order and identify the geometric series",
       "lines": [
        {
         "tex": "\\text{Total} &= 150\\left[1 + 1.004 + 1.004^2 + \\cdots + 1.004^{59}\\right]"
        },
        {
         "text": "The bracket is geometric with $a = 1$, $r = 1.004$ and $n = 60$."
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "title": "Use the sum formula",
       "lines": [
        {
         "tex": "S_{60} &= \\frac{1\\left(1.004^{60} - 1\\right)}{1.004 - 1}",
